{"suttaId":"thi-ap29","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[9718,9761],"vripara":"411"},"segments":{"thi-ap29:0.3":"Yasodharāpamukhadasabhikkhunīsahassaapadānaṃ","thi-ap29:1.1":"“Kappe ca satasahasse, caturo ca asaṅkhiye;","thi-ap29:1.3":"Dīpaṅkaro nāma jino, uppajji lokanāyako.","thi-ap29:2.1":"“Dīpaṅkaro mahāvīro, viyākāsi vināyako;","thi-ap29:2.3":"Sumedhañca sumittañca, samānasukhadukkhataṃ.","thi-ap29:3.1":"“Sadevakañca passanto, vicaranto sadevakaṃ;","thi-ap29:3.3":"Tesaṃ pakittane amhe, upagamma samāgamaṃ.","thi-ap29:4.1":"“Amhaṃ sabbapati hohi [sabbā patī honti (pī.)], anāgatasamāgame;","thi-ap29:4.3":"Sabbāva tuyhaṃ bhariyā, manāpā piyavādikā.","thi-ap29:5.1":"“Dānaṃ sīlamayaṃ sabbaṃ, bhāvanā ca subhāvitā;","thi-ap29:5.3":"Dīgharattañca no [dīgharattamidaṃ (syā. ka.)] sabbaṃ, pariccattaṃ mahāmune.","thi-ap29:6.1":"“Gandhaṃ vilepanaṃ mālaṃ, dīpañca ratanāmayaṃ;","thi-ap29:6.3":"Yaṃkiñci patthitaṃ sabbaṃ, pariccattaṃ mahāmuni.","thi-ap29:7.1":"“Aññaṃ vāpi kataṃ kammaṃ, paribhogañca mānusaṃ;","thi-ap29:7.3":"Dīgharattañhi no sabbaṃ, pariccattaṃ mahāmuni.","thi-ap29:8.1":"“Anekajātisaṃsāraṃ, bahuṃ puññampi no kataṃ;","thi-ap29:8.3":"Issaramanubhotvāna, saṃsaritvā bhavābhave.","thi-ap29:9.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, sakyaputtanivesane;","thi-ap29:9.3":"Nānākulūpapannāyo, accharā kāmavaṇṇinī.","thi-ap29:10.1":"“Lābhaggena yasaṃ pattā, pūjitā sabbasakkatā;","thi-ap29:10.3":"Lābhiyo annapānānaṃ, sadā sammānitā mayaṃ.","thi-ap29:11.1":"“Agāraṃ pajahitvāna, pabbajimhanagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap29:11.3":"Aḍḍhamāse asampatte, sabbā pattāmha nibbutiṃ.","thi-ap29:12.1":"“Lābhiyo annapānānaṃ, vatthasenāsanāni ca;","thi-ap29:12.3":"Upenti paccayā sabbe, sadā sakkatapūjitā.","thi-ap29:13.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā amhaṃ … pe … viharāma anāsavā.","thi-ap29:14.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata no āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap29:15.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap29:16.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ yasodharāpamukhāni dasabhikkhunīsahassāni bhagavato sammukhā imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap29:17.1":"Yasodharāpamukhadasabhikkhunīsahassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
